BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-12-26-brick_run-brick-run-straight-o@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20261226T090000
DTEND:20261226T091000
SUMMARY:[RW] Brick run (straight off the bike) (10 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min easy-steady run\, RPE 3-5. Legs often feel heavy for th
 e first 5 minutes: normal. Keep it easy: running straight after cycling c
 osts more energy than running fresh (Millet and Vleck 2000)\, and whether
  bricks improve that is unproven (Walsh 2019). Stop if anything hurts.\n\
 nWeek 5 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move mean
 s stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
