  8 min cool-down. Tempo is comfortably hard (RPE 6\, about 76-90 % of FTP
 ). Even power\, seated.\n\nWeek 6 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that
  changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
